Responsibilities:

- detect authentication context
- establish theme
- render public/authenticated structure
- provide shell context
- coordinate global shell state

It should not own project domain data.

---

# 98. PublicShell

Responsibilities:

- public top navigation
- public content frame
- footer integration
- public responsive behavior

---

# 99. AuthenticatedShell

Responsibilities:

- top navigation
- workplace context
- role sidebar
- main content viewport
- shell-level notifications/search/profile
- responsive workspace frame

---

# 100. TopNav Component

Responsibilities:

- brand
- navigation grouping
- workplace
- search
- notifications
- profile/auth actions

It should remain composition-oriented rather than embedding domain workflows.

---

# 101. Sidebar Component

Responsibilities:

- role navigation
- active route
- collapsed state
- responsive drawer integration

It should consume navigation configuration rather than hardcoding business logic throughout the component.

